//! Aula F99 LED map. The firmware numbers LEDs by matrix column then row
//! (`column * 6 + row`; Esc = 0, Space = 35). Generated from the `[KEY]`
//! section of the official driver's `Dev/kb/1/KB.ini`: each key's rectangle
//! in the driver's key-image pixels and its LED index (the last field). The
//! rectangles draw the keyboard in the GUI; their centres order the LEDs left
//! to right for effects.

/// (LED index, key name, keycap label, [left, top, right, bottom], Windows
/// virtual-key code as the official driver lists it).
pub type Led = (u8, &'static str, &'static str, [u16; 4], u8);

